# Badlands (39-40): the Horde quests of Kargath, Lotwil's camp, Rigglefuzz and Theldurin, for a
# Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/badlands_39_40.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Badlands, area 3). The
# quest list is section 19 of addon/guides/horde_1_40_allocation.md.
# Left out:
#   Solution to Doom (709): the Tablet of Ryun'eh is in a chest inside Uldaman, a dungeon; To the
#   Undercity for Yagyin's Digest (728) follows it. Forbidden Knowledge (737) follows 728 and The
#   Star, the Hand and the Heart (736), whose three items drop in Swamp of Sorrows, Stranglethorn
#   Vale and Alterac Mountains.
#   Uldaman Reagent Run (2202): the Magenta Cap Clusters grow inside Uldaman.
#   Translating the Journal (2338): the journal comes from the Remains of a Paladin inside Uldaman.
#   Compendium of the Fallen (1049): the book is in the Scarlet Monastery library, a dungeon.
# Carried in (skipped by those who lack them): Martek the Exiled (1106, Fizzle Brassbolts in
# Thousand Needles), Frostmaw (1136, Frostmaw's Mane from Alterac Mountains), The Black Shield
# (1276, Krog in Dustwallow Marsh), Theldurin the Lost (687, Zaruk in Hammerfall), and Twice
# Misplaced Trust (97332, Wharfmaster Lozgil in Booty Bay), only passing through.
# Left to later guides: News for Fizzle (1137, Tanaris), Report to Helgrum (1420, Stonard),
# Finding Tan'jani (95143, Rog'mar) and Twice Misplaced Trust (97332, Powderfuse Port, in
# Riverglades (40-43)).
# Bought, not farmed: Lotwil's and Lucien's engineering quests want Frost Oil, a Gyrochronatom, a
# Healing Potion, a Lesser Invisibility Potion and Patterned Bronze Bracers, and Rigglefuzz wants
# Blue Pearls from Stranglethorn Vale: the guide buys them in Undercity halfway through.
#
# The route: Hammerfall, Thandol Span, the Wetlands and Loch Modan on foot into the Badlands;
# Rigglefuzz, Lotwil and Kargath to take the quests; a loop west of Kargath (the lesser rock
# elementals, the buzzards, the Dustbowl ogres); a flight to Undercity for the auction house, the
# zeppelin and Thunder Bluff, and the hearthstone back to Kargath; Lotwil; south to the rock
# elementals, Theldurin and the troggs, back by Martek and Rigglefuzz; the Shadowforge dig site;
# west again to Camp Boff and the greater rock elementals; Lotwil's last quests; south out of the
# Badlands into the Riverglades.

guide Badlands (39-40)
faction horde
levels 39 40
carry 243 669 687 1106 1136 1240 1270 1276 1373 95141 97332
leave 243 669 1137 1240 1270 1373 1420 95141 95143 97332
next Riverglades (40-43)

# Into the Badlands ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Undercity
fly "Hammerfall, Arathi" npc 4551
tip Already in the Arathi Highlands? Skip the flight and make for Hammerfall, or straight for Thandol Span if Tor'gan has nothing for you.
map Arathi Highlands
accept 95143
tip Tor'gan's brother went south through the Badlands to the Riverglades: you will find him at the start of the next guide.
goto "Ride west from Hammerfall and take the road south past Refuge Pointe to Thandol Span, the great bridge into the Wetlands" at 45.5,89.0 r 30
tip Refuge Pointe is an Alliance camp: keep to the road and give it room.
map Wetlands
goto "Cross Thandol Span and follow the road south through the Wetlands to Dun Algaz" at 53.0,71.0 r 40
map Badlands
goto "Go through Dun Algaz into Loch Modan, follow the road south past Thelsamar, then the trail south over the mountains into the Badlands" at 47.5,16.0 r 40
tip Thelsamar is a dwarf town: ride around it. The trail comes down near the Shadowforge dig site in the north; you will be back there later.

# Rigglefuzz, Lotwil and Kargath --------------------------------------------------------------------

accept 703 705 2418
tip Rigglefuzz and Martek share a small camp by the road in the middle of the Badlands.
turnin 1106
accept 1108
accept 710 713
tip Lotwil paces around his machine; Lucien stands next to it. Frost Oil comes later, from the Undercity auction house.
accept 1419 1420
tip Neeka Bloodscar keeps watch from the top of a tower. Report to Helgrum is for Stonard, in a later guide: keep it.
accept 97663
accept 2258
tip Jarkal is upstairs in the building at the back of Kargath.
fpath 2861
bind 9356

# West of Kargath: the lesser rock elementals, the buzzards and the Dustbowl ogres ------------------

do 1419 bg at 18.5,78.7
do 2258.2 bg at 18.5,78.7
tip Every Crag Coyote drops a jawbone; only about one in three drops a fang. The Elder Crag Coyotes roam all of the west.
do 2258.3 bg
do 710
tip The Lesser Rock Elementals crowd the slopes west of Lotwil's camp.
do 703 mobs 2831 at 16.4,60.3
do 2258.1 mobs 2831 at 16.4,60.3
tip The Giant Buzzards circle the canyon south-east of Kargath.
do 97663.1 at 27.2,63.6
tip Ogres camp in the Dustbowl, south of Lotwil's camp.
do 97663.2 at 31.7,60.9 icon use "Use Mus'hale's Stolen Supplies on the small etched stone"
do 97663.3 at 28.2,60.3 icon use "Use Mus'hale's Stolen Supplies on the large etched stone"
turnin 710
accept 711
turnin 97663

# Undercity and Thunder Bluff ------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Undercity, Tirisfal" npc 2861
map Undercity
ah 713.1 npc 8672
tip Lotwil and Lucien want five crafted things: Frost Oil, a Gyrochronatom, a Healing Potion, a Lesser Invisibility Potion and Patterned Bronze Bracers. Nothing in the Badlands drops them: buy them here, or bring your own if you are an alchemist, engineer or blacksmith.
ah 714.1 npc 8672
tip Elizabeth Van Talen, the engineering supplier in the Rogues' Quarter, also sells Gyrochronatoms.
ah 715.1 npc 8672
ah 715.2 npc 8672
ah 716.1 npc 8672
ah 705.1 npc 8672
tip Rigglefuzz's 9 Blue Pearls come from the clams of the Vile Reef in Stranglethorn Vale. Buy them here, or skip Pearl Diving.
map Durotar
note "Take the zeppelin from the tower outside Undercity to Durotar" at 50.8,13.4
map Orgrimmar
fly "Thunder Bluff, Mulgore" npc 3310
map Thunder Bluff
turnin 1276
tip Mosarn must see the Blackened Iron Shield: take it out of the bank first if you stored it there.
turnin 1136
tip Melor Stonehoof is on Hunter Rise.
hearth npc 9356

# Lotwil's camp -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Badlands
turnin 713
tip No Frost Oil? Then skip Gyro... What?, Liquid Stone and This Is Going to Be Hard: they all follow it.
accept 714
turnin 714
accept 715
turnin 715

# South: the rock elementals, Theldurin and the troggs ----------------------------------------------

do 711 at 39.0,75.9
tip Large Stone Slabs drop rarely: the shards for Jarkal come along on the way.
turnin 687
accept 692
tip Theldurin the Lost sits alone by the southern mountains.
do 692
tip The Enraged Rock Elementals (level 42-43) fight over the fragments south-east of Theldurin; any of them can drop each of the three.
turnin 692
do 1108
tip The Stonevault troggs camp north of Theldurin; the Bonesnappers and Shamans both drop the flakes.
turnin 1108
accept 1137
tip Martek has news for Fizzle in Thousand Needles: a later guide takes it there.
turnin 703
turnin 705

# The Shadowforge dig site ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 2418
tip The Shadowforge dwarves (elites, level 35-37) work the dig site in the north. An'Alleum stones drop often, Dentrium stones about one time in five.
tip They sometimes drop a Shattered Necklace too: keep it, Dran Droffers in Orgrimmar buys it back in Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (41-43).
turnin 2418

# West again: Camp Boff and the greater rock elementals -----------------------------------------------

turnin 711
accept 712
grind 40 at 19.4,42.8
tip Gorn, in Kargath, gives Broken Alliances from level 40. The kills so far have most likely brought you there; if not, the lesser rock elementals on the way finish it.
accept 782
do 782 at 12.6,75.5
tip Boss Tho'grun (level 41-42) leads the Dustbelcher ogres of Camp Boff, in the south-west; he may be out walking among their camps.
do 712
tip The Greater Rock Elementals (level 42-44) stand in the far south-west corner, just past Camp Boff.
do 2258.3 mobs 2736 at 3.6,80.2
do 1419 at 12.2,65.6
do 2258.2 at 12.2,65.6
do 2258.1 mobs 2831 at 16.4,60.3
