# On to the Riverglades ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

goto "Ride south-east past the rock elementals and Theldurin to the pass at the southern edge of the Badlands" at 54.0,86.0 r 30
note "The next guide starts at Rog'mar: ride down the pass into the Riverglades and follow the road east to Rog'mar" at 54.0,86.0
tip A Twilight camp (levels 42-45) sits by the road at the foot of the pass: keep riding.
